            </note>
            <note corresp="#d80-f2" n="49" xml:id="d80-f2-content">
                <p>i. e., of the Memel Convention signed May 8, 1924; for text, see League of
                    Nations Treaty Series, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">xxix</hi>, p. 86.</p>
            </note>
